<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To check the correctness of the answers, we used the same prompts as previous studies presented in Figure <a href="#Ax1.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ Appendix ‣ On the Role of Unobserved Sequences on Sample-based Uncertainty Quantification for LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Ax1.F3" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="Ax1.F3.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_figure_panel" height="180.54" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 180.54" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,180.54) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 174.63 C 0 177.89 2.64 180.54 5.91 180.54 L 647.24 180.54 C 650.51 180.54 653.15 177.89 653.15 174.63 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 154.89 L 651.18 154.89 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 164.25)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt (single answer)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 133.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:8.65em;font-size:10pt;" height="129.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We are assessing the quality of answers to the following question: <span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">{</span><span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">question</span><span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">}</span> \n
The expected answer is: <span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">{</span><span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">correct_answer</span><span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">}</span>. \n The proposed answer is: <span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">{</span><span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">predicted_answer</span><span id="Ax1.F3.pic1.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">}</span> \n Within the context of the question, does the proposed answer mean the same as the expected answer? \n Respond only with yes or no.\n Response:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="Ax1.F3.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_figure_panel" height="180.54" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 180.54" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,180.54) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 174.63 C 0 177.89 2.64 180.54 5.91 180.54 L 647.24 180.54 C 650.51 180.54 653.15 177.89 653.15 174.63 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 154.89 L 651.18 154.89 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 164.25)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
